{%- doc -%}
  Daewoo Security — accessories hub (reset build under a fresh section
  type name, to rule out any stale state tied to the old
  daewoo-accessories-hub identifier after many API + editor round trips).

  Static isolation test: no Liquid conditionals, no blocks, no images.
{%- enddoc -%}

<style>
  .daewoo-reset__intro {
    max-width: 42rem;
    margin: 0 auto;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .daewoo-reset__grid {
    margin-top: 2rem;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }
</style>

<div class="section daewoo-reset section--padding">
  <div class="page-width daewoo-reset__intro">
    <h1 class="heading">TEST RESET — nouveau nom de section</h1>
    <p>Si vous voyez ce texte et 3 rectangles colorés, le reset a fonctionné.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="page-width daewoo-reset__grid">
    <div style="background:#c00; height:200px; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; color:#fff; font-weight:bold; border-radius:16px;">BOX 1</div>
    <div style="background:#080; height:200px; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; color:#fff; font-weight:bold; border-radius:16px;">BOX 2</div>
    <div style="background:#06c; height:200px; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; color:#fff; font-weight:bold; border-radius:16px;">BOX 3</div>
  </div>
</div>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Daewoo — Reset test",
  "settings": []
}
{% endschema %}
